OL,3,GNEWSA'Buzz around town' as new comedy
OL,4,Aseries filmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilming for a comedy series by Gavin
OL,7,Fand Stacey creators James Corden and
OL,8,FRuth Jones has sparked excitement among
OL,9,FLewes residents.
OL,11,FThe East Sussex town has been renamed
OL,12,FAlderswyck for the show called The
OL,13,FChoir, which is about a long-lost
OL,14,Fbrother and sister reuniting at
OL,15,FChristmas.
OL,17,FA charity shop was converted into a
OL,18,Fpost office, the John Harvey Tavern was
OL,19,Fmade into Woody's Pub and filming has
OL,20,Fbeen taking place in Fitzroy House all
OL,21,Faround Cliffe High Street.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
